<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuelan markets, banks closed Monday.</title>
<headline>Venezuelan markets, banks closed Monday.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuelan financial markets and banks are closed on Monday, in observance of Epiphany.</p>
<p>They will reopen on Tuesday.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
